- [S2] STC8 failed: Each action node must have exactly one incoming and one outgoing edge. | Node `n5` has in=1 and out=0. | Node `n7` has in=1 and out=0. | DSL: action(n5,"Send a Denial to the Customer due to Credit Limit"); action(n7,"Send a Denial to the Customer due to Article Unavailability")
- [S3] STC20 failed: Every non-end node must have a path to at least one end node. | Violations: n5, n7 | DSL: action(n5,"Send a Denial to the Customer due to Credit Limit"); action(n7,"Send a Denial to the Customer due to Article Unavailability")